            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o ĩvinda yĩu Yeova aneenie na kanyw’a wa Isaia mwana wa Amosu, akyasya, Enda, umye ĩkunia yĩla wĩvotoete kĩnyunyunĩ kyaku, noyumya iatũ syaku maũũ. Nake eeka ũu, akĩenda e mũthei na maũũ me mathei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
